      {
        "kind": "text",
        "text": "The reference class and base rate are recent monthly moves in the same ABS seasonally adjusted unemployment-rate series. From Jul-23 through May-26, the rate rose from 3.697010 to 4.355949, but individual monthly changes were noisy, including Apr-26 up to 4.481340 and May-26 down to 4.355949."
