        "text": "Level and momentum: May's 4.355949 is the cleanest public anchor. The trend estimate of 4.361273 and year-on-year unemployment-rate increase of 0.3 percentage points argue for a level around 4.4 to 4.5 rather than a reversion to early-2026 levels near 4.1."
      },
